          <div class="hero-visual" data-starpil-hero="" aria-label="Featured Starpil product photography"><div class="hero-visual-slides"><img class="hero-visual-slide hero-photo-slide is-active" data-starpil-hero-slide="" src="/starpil_website/static/src/img/hero-official-blue-wax.png" alt="Professional blue wax application by Starpil"/><img class="hero-visual-slide hero-product-slide hero-coral-slide" data-starpil-hero-slide="" src="/starpil_website/static/src/img/hero-official-coral.png" alt="Starpil Coral professional hard wax" loading="lazy"/><img class="hero-visual-slide hero-product-slide hero-warmer-slide" data-starpil-hero-slide="" src="/starpil_website/static/src/img/hero-official-warmer.png" alt="Starpil professional wax warmer" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="hero-stamp"><span>STARPIL</span><strong>CARIBBEAN</strong><small>PROFESSIONAL SUPPLY</small></div><div class="hero-caption"><p>High-performance formulas.<br/>Made for working estheticians.</p></div><div class="hero-image-controls"><button class="hero-image-arrow" type="button" data-starpil-hero-prev="" aria-label="Previous banner image">←</button><div class="hero-image-dots"><button class="hero-image-dot is-active" type="button" data-starpil-hero-dot="0" aria-label="Show image 1"/><button class="hero-image-dot" type="button" data-starpil-hero-dot="1" aria-label="Show image 2"/><button class="hero-image-dot" type="button" data-starpil-hero-dot="2" aria-label="Show image 3"/></div><button class="hero-image-arrow" type="button" data-starpil-hero-next="" aria-label="Next banner image">→</button></div></div>
        </section>

        <section class="trust-strip" aria-label="Starpil benefits"><div><span class="trust-icon">✓</span><p><strong>Authentic Starpil</strong><small>Official local product supply</small></p></div><div><span class="trust-icon">✦</span><p><strong>Certified pros only</strong><small>Exclusive approved pricing</small></p></div><div><span class="trust-icon">→</span><p><strong>Caribbean delivery</strong><small>Custom Odoo delivery options</small></p></div><div><span class="trust-icon">◎</span><p><strong>Real-time account</strong><small>Stock, orders and rewards</small></p></div></section>

