        <section class="editorial-grid"><article class="editorial-image"><img src="/starpil_website/static/src/img/gold-soft-wax.webp" alt="Professional Starpil waxing setup"/><div><span>PROFESSIONAL SUPPORT</span><h2>More than products.<br/>A partner in your treatment room.</h2></div></article><article class="editorial-copy"><span class="kicker">The Starpil difference</span><h2>Made for the people behind every smooth result.</h2><p>From choosing the right wax to keeping your treatment room stocked, Starpil Caribbean supports certified beauty professionals with authentic products, local access and responsive guidance.</p><div class="editorial-points"><div><span>Professional-grade performance</span></div><div><span>Esthetician-approved systems</span></div><div><span>Caribbean-focused service</span></div><div><span>Real-time Odoo ordering</span></div></div><a class="button button-dark" href="/contact">Talk to our team</a></article></section>

